[program:acme-nostderr]
Runs python3 worker.py as you. Starts with supervisord, restarts it only if it exits with an unexpected code, and gives it 10 seconds to stop. Output goes to /var/log/acme/out.log. Errors go to an auto-named file in supervisord's log folder.
! acme-nostderr has no stderr_logfile, so errors go to an auto-named file in supervisord's log folder.
